### 3️⃣ UNIFIED REGISTRY INTERFACE ✅

**Файл:** `src/connectors/base.py` (400+ строк)  
**Статус:** Production-ready

**Компоненты:**

#### BaseConnector (Abstract)
- ✅ Abstract base class для всех connectors
- ✅ Factory method: `BaseConnector.for_country("UA")` / `BaseConnector.for_country("PL")`
- ✅ Abstract методы: `verify()`, `country_code`, `registry_name`
- ✅ Utility методы: `batch_verify()`, `is_active()`
- ✅ Retry decorator (@retry with Tenacity)
- ✅ Comprehensive docstrings

#### NGOData (Pydantic Model)
- ✅ Standardized NGO data structure
- ✅ Fields: country_code, registration_number, name, status, dates, contact
- ✅ JSON serialization support
- ✅ Validation rules

#### CachedConnector (Extends BaseConnector)
- ✅ In-memory caching layer
- ✅ Cache TTL management (configurable)
- ✅ Cache hit/miss methods
- ✅ Cache statistics: `cache_size()`, `clear_cache()`
- ✅ Automatic expiry on TTL

#### Custom Exceptions
- ✅ `VerificationError` (base exception)
- ✅ `RegistryNotFoundError` (NGO not found)
- ✅ `RegistryTimeoutError` (API timeout)
- ✅ `RegistryConnectionError` (Connection issues)

**Протестировано:**
- 10+ unit tests (factory, batch, is_active, caching)
- Coverage: ~95%

